{%- comment -%}
  robots.txt.liquid
  Version:      4.0.0
  Last updated: 2026-07-30
  Author:       Legendary Branding / Claude Code

  Changes from v3.0.0:
    — Blocked /*?*variant= — Shopify generates a unique URL per product variant
      (colour, size, etc.). Without this rule, a product with 10 variants consumes
      10× the crawl budget on near-identical pages, crowding out canonical URLs.
    — Blocked /account — session-dependent page with zero SEO value; indexing it
      creates thin-content risk and wastes crawl budget on authenticated UI.
    — Blocked /cart — dynamic, user-specific page; no indexable content and exposes
      checkout flow structure to bots unnecessarily.
    — Added Applebot-Extended named block — Apple Intelligence / Siri Suggestions
      (iOS 18+) is the fastest-growing AI commerce surface. Explicit Allow signals
      cooperative intent for product discovery via Siri and Apple Search.
    — Added DuckAssistBot named block — DuckDuckGo AI Answers crawler; added for
      completeness across major AI answer surfaces.

  Changes from v2.0.0 (see v3.0.0 header for full list).

  Agentic Commerce note:
    GPTBot (OpenAI training), OAI-SearchBot (ChatGPT web search/shopping),
    ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, meta-externalagent, Amazonbot,
    Applebot-Extended (Apple Intelligence/Siri), and DuckAssistBot are explicitly
    allowed via named user-agent blocks.
    Explicit Allow signals cooperative intent and improves AI discovery
    ranking versus relying on inherited wildcard rules.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ─── SHOPIFY DEFAULT GROUPS ────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- for group in robots.default_groups -%}
  {{- group.user_agent -}}

  {%- for rule in group.rules -%}
    {{- rule -}}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- comment -%} Inject custom rules for the wildcard (*) user-agent only {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if group.user_agent.value == '*' -%}

    {%- comment -%} ── PARAMETERIZED URL BLOCKING ──────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*stkn=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*com_cvv=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*currency=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*country=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*sort_by=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*variant=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*utm_source=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*utm_medium=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*utm_campaign=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*utm_content=' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*?*utm_term=' }}

    {%- comment -%} ── LOW-VALUE SHOPIFY PAGES ─────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'Disallow: /search?' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /account' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /cart' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*/collections/vendors' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*/collections/types' }}

    {%- comment -%} ── PHANTOM LOCALE PATHS (not published, already indexed) ─ {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'Disallow: /de/' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /de' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /fr/' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /fr' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /es/' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /es' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*/collections/all-products' }}
{{ 'Disallow: /*/pages/html-sitemap' }}

    {%- comment -%} ── CDN ASSET PATHS ─────────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'Disallow: /cdn/shop/files/' }}

  {%- endif -%}

  {{- group.sitemap -}}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- comment -%} ─── AI AGENT CRAWLERS (allow content pages, block noise) ──── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Each named AI block:
    Allow: /           — full site access for product/content discovery
    Disallow locale    — phantom /de /fr /es paths (with and without trailing slash)
    Disallow params    — UTM, currency, country query strings (query-anchored pattern)
    Sitemap            — explicit pointer so AI crawlers find the product catalog
{%- endcomment -%}
